{"t":"Rookgaard Academy","s":"rookgaard-academy-13079","k":"local","i":"assets/wiki/Rookgaard_Academy_map_7bf57d.png","q":2,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><figure class=\"thumb show-info-icon\" style=\"width: 180px\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> <img alt=\"The Rookgaard Academy\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"175\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Rookgaard_Academy_map_7bf57d.png\" width=\"180\"/> <figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> <svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg> <p class=\"caption\">The Rookgaard Academy</p> </figcaption> </figure>\n<p>The <b>Rookgaard Academy</b> is the building directly north of the <a href=\"#/wiki/Rookgaard\">Rookgaard</a> <a href=\"#/wiki/Temple\">temple</a>. It serves as a valuable location for new players, offering essential NPCs and resources.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Ground_floor\">Ground floor</span></h2>\n<figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-left show-info-icon\" style=\"width: 400px\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> <img alt=\" &amp; \" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"293\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Seymour_361bec.png\" width=\"400\"/> <figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> <svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg> <p class=\"caption\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Seymour\">Seymour</a> &amp; <a href=\"#/wiki/Vascalir\">Vascalir</a></p> </figcaption> </figure>\n<p>Here, players can find NPCs <a href=\"#/wiki/Vascalir\">Vascalir</a>, who offers missions for <a href=\"#/quest/the-rookie-guard-quest\">the Rookie Guard Quest</a>, and <a href=\"#/wiki/Seymour\">Seymour</a>, who provides knowledge about Tibia to newcomers. For the library located here, see Rookgaard Libraries.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-First_floor\">First floor</span></h2>\n<figure class=\"thumb show-info-icon\" style=\"width: 400px\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> <img alt=\"\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"293\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/The_Oracle_c4c37d.png\" width=\"400\"/> <figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> <svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg> <p class=\"caption\"><a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Oracle\">The Oracle</a></p> </figcaption> </figure>\n<p>Upon reaching level 8, players can speak with <a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Oracle\">The Oracle</a> and be teleported to the <a href=\"#/wiki/Island%20of%20Destiny\">Island of Destiny</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Underground_floor\">Underground floor</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Bank\">Bank</span></h3>\n<figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-left show-info-icon\" style=\"width: 400px\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> <img alt=\" and the bank\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"293\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Rookgaard_Bank_8e7b89.png\" width=\"400\"/>  <figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> <svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg> <p class=\"caption\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Paulie\">Paulie</a> and the bank</p> </figcaption> </figure>\n<p>On this floor, <a href=\"#/wiki/Paulie\">Paulie</a> manages the local Bank. Additionally, players can interact with <a href=\"#/wiki/Amber\">Amber</a>, an adventurer with captivating tales. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Exhibition\">Exhibition</span></h3>\n<figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-right show-info-icon\" style=\"width: 400px\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> <img alt=\"The Exhibition\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"293\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Rookgaard_Exhibition_783f5d.png\" width=\"400\"/>  <figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> <svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg> <p class=\"caption\">The Exhibition</p> </figcaption> </figure>\n<p>The area also features an exhibition showcasing objects and creatures found on the main continent.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Historic\">Historic</span></h3>\n<p>Before the revamp of <a href=\"#/wiki/Rookgaard\">Rookgaard</a> and the introduction of <a href=\"#/quest/the-rookie-guard-quest\">The Rookie Guard Quest</a>, this floor housed a training room with a <a href=\"#/wiki/Spider\">Spider</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Bug\">Bug</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Wolf\">Wolf</a>, and a <a href=\"#/wiki/Troll\">Troll</a>, accessible with Key 4600. However, this room no longer exists, and the Key 4600 is no longer obtainable.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div></div>","quests":["captain-iglues-treasure-quest","short-sword-quest"]}